    "feature-rule-suggestions-desc": "Board menu → Rules suggests rules from what people on the board keep doing by hand.",
    "feature-board-summary": "Summary",
    "feature-board-summary-desc": "Board menu → Summary shows what each person did on the board in the last day or week, and what they have overdue.",
    "feature-since-last-visit": "Since your last visit",
    "feature-since-last-visit-desc": "Board menu → Since your last visit lists what others changed on the board since you last had it open.",
